---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Sponsor — jev.info" description="Support the jev.info community index.">
  <main class="shell policy-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Project</p>
    <h1>Sponsor jev.info</h1>
    <p class="lede">jev.info is a community index. Sponsorship options are being prepared.</p>
    <section>
      <h2>What support will fund</h2>
      <p>Hosting, data maintenance, media delivery, translation, and the ongoing work required to keep the use case archive accurate and accessible.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Get in touch</h2>
      <p>Until a sponsorship program is available, you can open a contact request in the project repository.</p>
      <a class="action" href="https://github.com/wizicer/jev_info_site/issues/new?title=%5BSponsor%5D%20Sponsorship%20enquiry&body=Please%20tell%20us%20a%20little%20about%20your%20organisation%20and%20how%20you%20would%20like%20to%20support%20jev.info." target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Contact the project ↗</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .policy-page { min-height: 66vh; padding-block: 76px 110px; }
  .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 12px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 720; letter-spacing: .15em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  h1 { max-width: 760px; margin: 0; font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 32px); letter-spacing: -.045em; }
  .lede { max-width: 720px; margin: 20px 0 52px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; }
  section { max-width: 720px; padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  h2 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 18px; }
  section p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .action { display: inline-block; margin-top: 22px; color: var(--accent); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; }
</style>
